1895
01:25:47.490 --> 01:25:48.730
maybe just aggravated.
You mean like

1896
01:25:48.730 --> 01:25:50.120
allergic response.

1897
01:25:50.120 --> 01:25:51.150
Yeah.

1898
01:25:51.150 --> 01:25:56.150
